# Copy this file to `tokens.local` and put your real TabPFN cloud tokens below,
# ONE PER LINE. `tokens.local` is gitignored so your tokens never get committed.
# Alternatively, set the TABPFN_TOKENS env var (comma-separated) instead.
#
# tabpfn_sk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# tabpfn_sk_yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy
